These skills are translated into Japanese and modified: Cursor-specific paths,
models, agents, and dependencies on other pstack skills were removed or
replaced, and some skills were renamed or merged.

  principle-laziness-protocol         <- principle-laziness-protocol + principle-subtract-before-you-add
  principle-prove-it-works            <- principle-prove-it-works
  principle-fix-root-causes           <- principle-fix-root-causes
  principle-sequence-verifiable-units <- principle-sequence-verifiable-units
  principle-encode-lessons-in-structure <- principle-encode-lessons-in-structure
  principle-foundational-thinking     <- principle-foundational-thinking + principle-model-the-domain
  principle-minimize-reader-load      <- principle-minimize-reader-load
  principle-build-the-lever           <- principle-build-the-lever
  principle-guard-the-context-window  <- principle-guard-the-context-window
  meta-reflect                        <- reflect
  meta-create-verification            <- create-verification-skill
  meta-maintain-verification          <- maintain-verification-skill
  work-no-comments                    <- no-comments (incorporating the rules of the Comment Sicko agent)

principle-laziness-protocol also incorporates ideas from the ponytail skill by
